# Explorer's Cache {1}{G}: "This artifact enters with two +1/+1 counters on it. {T}: Move a +1/+1 counter from this artifact onto
# target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts it with Mox Emerald and Mox Jet and it enters with exactly two counters. A
# Mox is no creature, so it cannot be targeted (the refusal's positive control is the next line, the same activation aimed at the
# Ornithopter). The counter leaves the Cache for the Ornithopter (one left, and the Ornithopter is a 1/3), and the Cache is tapped, so a
# second activation is refused (CR 602.2) until it untaps on turn 3, when the second counter moves too (none left, the Ornithopter 2/4).

